{"labs": [{"stimuli": [{"id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": []}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe7n6le03ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "enpe7n6le03ob06re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"id": 0, "image": "enpe7n6le03ob06re2img01.jpg", "text": "<div align=\"justify\">JavaScript is a programming language that uses a variety of symbols which follow a set of rules to perform operations. Syntax in programming language is something that should be taken seriously as well as the different operators that may require lots of practice. Within the overwhelming world of programming, there is a bunch of things to be taken into account and to pay attention to before successfully executing your first JavaScript commands. Let's begin by taking a look at the importance of JavaScript.</div>", "time": "100"}, {"id": 1, "image": "enpe7n6le03ob06re2img02.jpg", "text": "<div align=\"justify\">JavaScript was created to make programmers' lives easier. One of the most notable advantages JavaScript has over other languages is that it can be interpreted or read by all browsers which makes it a universal programming language. Besides, its practicality and flexibility should be highlighted as, on the one hand, it isn't a very complex language for people to learn since it works perfectly for those who are starting up. And on the other hand, it is a programming language that could be used to work with a variety of functions. This widespread tool was so well built that it has been increasing its range of acceptance, and thus, popularity among users in the past years. Moreover, contrary to popular belief that software should be constantly updated, JavaScript hasn't needed major changes as times passes by. </div>", "time": "32000"}, {"id": 2, "image": "enpe7n6le03ob06re2img03.jpg", "text": "<div align=\"justify\">JavaScript was adopted in our company 5 years ago and since then, it became a \"must\" for programming. We are a web design company that was recently named as one of the top 4 companies in the state. From our standpoint, we used to be skeptical about JavaScript since web-based applications were considered an issue in language programming and we thought JavaScript was not going to be any better than the other languages. We now think it is the best suited technology for us and we are now quite aware of its advantages: Different frameworks can be used from front to back ends; JavaScript was chosen by huge enterprises as their trustworthy language programming for software development; and JavaScript reduces the costs in training and hiring staff. Overall, its importance relies on all the advantages and user-friendly features it offers.</div>", "time": "91000"}]}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": []}, {"id": 3, "type": "video", "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe7n6le03ob06re5vsc01", "images": [{"id": 0, "image": "", "text": "", "time": "0"}]}, "type": "video"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can understand written information about the importance of JavaScript.   ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can identify important vocabulary about Javascript.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can write a paragraph about the importance and use of Javascript in my organization.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What do you think would happen if JavaScript stopped working all of a sudden? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "How do you think JavaScript could be updated or improved? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"},