efits of JavaScript.</li>\n<li>Write 2 or 3 supporting sentences.</li>\n<li> Close your paragraph.</li>\n</ul>\nWhen you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span\nclass=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button.</span>\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<strong>It's time to review your paragraph.</strong><br/><br/>\n\n<span class=\"italic\">When you are writing a paragraph, remember to include:<br/><br/>\n<ul>\n<li>A main idea</li>\n<li>sentences that support the main idea</li>\n<li>Your own words</li>\n</ul>\nProofread your paragraph for any spelling, grammar or punctuation errors.<br/><br/>\nRead your paragraph aloud to a partner.<br/><br/>\nClick the <strong>Submit</strong> button to save your work.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "grading_chart", "grading_contents": {"header": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 5, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}]}, {"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}]}]}, "body": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": [" "], "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": ["